{"server":"cn","storyId":"act32side_level_act32side_03_end","groupId":"act32side","stageId":"act32side_03","title":"假面舞池","storyCode":"CR-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"81923fe14db822f7551a36847da0cd10d1a1962a0b7175fb2f64b0d299de936a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"彩虹小队消除了与特克诺等人间的误会，真正体会到了艺术家们新奇的想法和蓬勃的生命力。艾拉将所见所闻告知了雷内尔，希望到街头艺术社区落脚，雷内尔没有拒绝。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，头好痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了，大个子，给，这是冰块，你的额头肿了很大一个包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是攻击我的那个孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再叫我一句孩子我就让你后脑勺再肿一个包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之就是，他们丢失的药品找回来了，所以他们和我们之间的误会也解除了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么药品？什么误会？怎么解决的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通过一位可怜的司机先生，他的嘴很硬，但又没那么硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我觉得更混乱了......我们现在在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我扶你出去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的药，请拿好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......谢谢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫什么？在这里打个钩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"迈克......好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这里还剩两份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再从头核对一下名单，说不定是有人忘了拿......看看还有谁没来签字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......最后两份药是我的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你，特克诺小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......今天发生的事情我很抱歉，我们不知道抢劫事件另有他人指使......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，这些药品能物归原主就是最好的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古斯塔夫告诉我，这里很多人都患有一种特殊疾病，如果没有这些抑制药剂，后果不堪设想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说，那个上尉不是之前和雷内尔不对付吗？为什么一转脸就要抢我们的药来讨好雷内尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米沃什告诉我，他是冲雷内尔手里对这片社区的开发权而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，有开发权又如何？这两年就算雷内尔自己拿着开发文件不也一样对我们束手无策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那挺好，你们的社区文化很吸引人，就这样被开发成酒店赌场我觉得很可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不过是在这里站了半天罢了，说得好像很了解这里一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过半天，但几乎每个来领药的人都极力向我推销自己的艺术作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是要吃饭的嘛......话说你胳膊上那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是串刺绣手链，本来不打算买的，但是看见那孩子满手都是针扎的痕迹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）谁家的孩子啊，这么笨手笨脚的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我说......你想去我的工作室坐坐吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖会主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"五千万哥伦比亚金券，没有再加价的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖会主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，五千万金券落槌！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么......一直丢东西的仓库？哪间仓库？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是被你收购半年之后就倒闭的那家药企的仓库。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好像是有这么回事......所以有人抢了那片社区的药，栽赃到你们头上，然后又想偷偷把药运到那间仓库去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准确来说，是你头上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我现在该怎么做？谢谢你帮我化解了这场误会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用谢，雷内尔先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听米沃什说你们打算离开我提供的住所了。怎么，找到自己的朋友们了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我们只是找到了另外一处落脚的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片社区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里？虽然我也没什么异议，但你们为什么要离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那里看到了些很有意思的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是我的工作室了。这里空间很大，我和其他的艺术家在这里共同创作，寻找灵感，有的作品也在这里展出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些洇湿了的画纸，看来是一些废弃的灵感了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那个是作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作品？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有个家伙每画完一幅画都会把画拿到室外，一直等到下雨，让雨水化开已经铺陈好的颜料，改变原有的画面，这幅画才算完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个正在展示自己完美肌肉线条的男人......应该在寻找灵感？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"严格来说，他也是作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，行为艺术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面有个牌子，你要不要读一读？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“作品名，佩佩·图里翁......作者，佩佩·图里翁的父母......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“作品简介，作者在作品问世半年后因嫌弃作品没有经济价值，将其丢弃至多索雷斯城郊......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“作者未曾想到......二十年后......佩佩·图里翁......成为了多索雷斯的传世名作......老家伙们，后悔去吧！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我是多索雷斯最伟大的源石技艺大师。你们是否想观摩我的源石技艺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺，他比你还厉害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在源石技艺上，无人能出其右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"展示的时候小心一些，可别伤到客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人从口袋里掏出数颗隐隐泛出橙黄色光芒的黑色晶体。四人谨慎地往后退了几步。\n至纯源石在男人宽大的掌心中滴溜溜旋转，然后被男人挨个抛到天上——\n他开始用至纯源石做抛接球。\n数轮抛接之后，男人把所有的至纯源石一口气抛上天，仰面朝天，用鼻尖稳稳接住第一颗下落的至纯源石。\n两颗，三颗，四颗......最终，所有的晶体一颗接一颗，在男人的鼻尖上稳稳摞成一座高塔。\n男人稍微侧了侧头，至纯源石摞成的塔几乎平移一样回到他的手心里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技艺......不是闪光、火球什么的吗？这......也是源石技艺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这难道不是源石？我刚刚展示的难道不是技艺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确......实......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打开你们面前这扇门，就是我们最重磅的艺术品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然这话最近好像说过，但我还想再说一次——我看见什么都已经不会觉得奇怪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两个......大木偶的头？这么大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还只是头呢，等身体组装起来会更大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的艺术节开幕那一夜，她们将成为两个舞者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当双月缓缓落下，日光却还没照耀到我们的时候，她们将会起舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们会成为目光的焦点、艺术节的主角，她们会用最美的舞姿在街道上翩翩旋转，她们会代替我们踩着韵律，转遍整个社区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很美的画面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那时，我想一定也会有许多人跟着人偶一起舞蹈吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，也许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当年舞厅发生火灾后，已经许久没有人愿意起舞了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我跟你说的，那里有很多新奇的结构、充沛的情感、精妙的表达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有意思......你的描述确实让我对这些人在做的东西好奇起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你打算去那个社区，不如替我去看看那里的人究竟要做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是一直很反感他们把艺术节和你的开幕式定在同一天吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不代表我不能对他们要做的东西感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以替你去看他们在做什么，但我没理由介入你和他们的矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会让你介入？当然，如果你真的能说动那些人，让他们换个日子，我会非常感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这可没法保证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"试试总比不试强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，你愿意去了解那些人在做的事情让我很惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你愿意了解我，我想你应该就不会惊讶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖会主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"257号藏品八音盒，一千五百万金券起拍，有人要加价吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘......现在我得专心投入进去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（举牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖会主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您的竞投，两千万，还有人要加吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（举牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖会主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......同一人，加到两千五百万？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（举牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经抬得够高了，场子里根本没人和你争！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（举牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我才不在乎别人出什么价，我只想把它加到我心里的价位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是我太鲁莽了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们确实也没想到那群疯子真有这么无法无天，居然敢这么羞辱联合政府的职业军人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，明白！我下次——不，绝对没有下次了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是再有下次，您撤了我的职，处分我，怎么都成！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴吧，这下上面也知道门口那个开卡车的活宝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他被脱光衣服扔到了我们办公室大门口，上面觉得这是对联合政府的公然侮辱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们问我和雷内尔的合作关系还能不能维持，那块地皮还有没有希望拿到，我能说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*，这些个办事不力的蠢货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉，我是想说，雷内尔的秘书来了......我们见还是不见？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......让他进来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是代表雷内尔来兴师问罪的，那就免了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢，马特奥先生？雷内尔对您的效率是很满意的，美中不足的是，您的行动方式多少有些冒险了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片社区的感染者数量不小，抢药确实是个瓦解他们的方法。可您应该想到，假如真的有很多感染者因此去世......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"处理不好，我们谁都没法交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个问题我们已经意识到了。那他......还跟你说什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛，他的意思是，既然之前太过冒险了，现在不如稍微谨慎一些，说不定还能有和平解决的余地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，都到这个时候了，你反而要我去和那些人谈判？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马特奥先生，您会错意了，这事不用您操心，雷内尔先生已经派人去做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾拉小姐和她的小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想必很熟悉他们，我没说错吧？他们和您的手下打过照面，甚至还有人把您的手下和他们弄混呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要忘了，米沃什，我们可是做了约定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少安毋躁，马特奥先生，雷内尔不打算放弃和您合作，只是希望您能稍微冷静一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地皮的事情，希望等您冷静下来我们再谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您还有什么话要我带给雷内尔先生吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先告辞了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来......你*粗口*是耍着我玩来的，是吧，雷内尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*......雷内尔，要是我最后没能从你手里拿到那块地，你就死定了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一亿五千万？他一个人把一只八音盒加到一亿五千万？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从他的出价来看，虽然这家伙随心所欲，但至少对他认定是艺术的东西还算真诚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来你对他有些改观......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对他从来就没有什么意见，梅捷，他只是个很难捉摸的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是他有意思的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实......我承认，他不是传统意义上那种无趣的艺术品商人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能从你的口中听到这样的评价已经算是不错了，很难得有一个你不那么反感的雇主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那之后呢？你打算继续与他的合同吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚......但我会考虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，我们是该谢谢他，如果不是他提供的帮助，我们不会这么快适应这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在我们救了他的分上，不用客气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿......艾拉，你能和我来一下吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的，老爹想要见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亚兹先生？他为什么找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爹说有些问题想要当面问你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我这就去见他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有就是那个......期间他可能会表现得很凶......非常可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......他打算给我个下马威。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他自己不这么认为，但......的确是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
